# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the multithreaded API tests (test/api/mt,
# label "mt"; preset tsan-mt, workflow tsan-mt.yml).
#
# Each entry is a known race of the engine built for several threads (the
# tsan-mt preset), under a "# <inventory ids> (P<n>): ..."
# comment that names its ids in the inventory of the thread-safety design and
# the PR of its plan that removes it (the workflow's summary reads that
# comment). The PR that fixes a race deletes its entries, so the job then
# fails if the race is still there; a race not listed here fails its test.

# L2 (P12): ICU UText clone inside RegexPattern compilation reads a block
# another thread's compilation allocated (fn:tokenize folded at compile time;
# each thread compiles its own regex). ICU is not built with TSan; P12 decides
# whether this is ICU-internal sharing or a false positive.
race:shallowTextClone
